channel:B2B a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "firm-to-firm engagement"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (activity_type, observed_n=304, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:altLabel "B2B"@en,
        "Interfirm"@en ;
    skos:definition "Contractual, financial, supply-chain, technology-transfer and life-cycle acts between firms and project organizations. It is also called interfirm engagement."@en,
        "기업 및 사업조직 사이의 계약·금융·공급망·기술이전·생애주기 행위. 원고 표기는 Interfirm engagement."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which an export-side vendor and a local firm form a consortium or conclude a supply contract for equipment and materials."@en,
        "수출측 벤더와 현지 기업이 컨소시엄을 구성하거나 기자재 공급 계약을 체결한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme channel: ;
    skos:notation "B2B" ;
    skos:prefLabel "firm-to-firm engagement"@en,
        "기업 간 관여"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Excludes activities initiated by host-country actors (`scope.importing_country_actor`). Excludes third-party NGOs (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B has been retired and is reassigned to G2G (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@en,
        "Only export-side nuclear power plant export marketing activities are coded. The channel is determined by the combination of the acting party and the counterparty."@en,
        "The data code and the descriptive name differ on purpose. The code is the stable machine identifier used by the dataset, the logs and the existing replication package; the descriptive name says who the counterparty actually is — for B2G these include regulators, the project-owning state-owned enterprise and the public, which 'business-to-government' does not convey. Both are kept as altLabel so neither reading is lost."@en,
        "도입국 행위자 주도 활동 제외 (`scope.importing_country_actor`). 제3자 NGO 제외 (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B는 폐기되었으며 G2G로 재배정한다 (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@ko,
        "수출측(export-side) 원전 수출 마케팅 활동만 코딩한다 (manual `scope.rule`). 채널은 행위 주체와 상대의 조합으로 결정된다."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf channel: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ01;CQ09" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=304; status=in_use" .

channel:B2G a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "firm-to-authority engagement"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (activity_type, observed_n=652, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:altLabel "B2G"@en,
        "F2A"@en ;
    skos:definition "Engagement carried out by firms towards the decision-making interfaces of the host country. The counterparties are authorities, regulators and the project-owning entity, and public and community communication (B2G-4) is included. It is also called F2A (firm-to-authority)."@en,
        "기업이 도입국의 의사결정 인터페이스를 상대로 수행하는 관여. 상대는 당국, 규제기관, 발주 사업주이며 공중·지역사회 소통(B2G-4)을 포함한다. 원고 표기는 F2A (firm-to-authority)."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor submits a proposal in the tender procedure of a host-country procuring agency, or submits licensing documents to a regulator."@en,
        "벤더가 도입국 발주기관의 입찰 절차에 제안서를 제출하거나, 규제기관에 인허가 서류를 제출한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme channel: ;
    skos:notation "B2G" ;
    skos:prefLabel "firm-to-authority engagement"@en,
        "기업–당국 관여"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Excludes activities initiated by host-country actors (`scope.importing_country_actor`). Excludes third-party NGOs (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B has been retired and is reassigned to G2G (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@en,
        "Only export-side nuclear power plant export marketing activities are coded. The channel is determined by the combination of the acting party and the counterparty."@en,
        "The data code and the descriptive name differ on purpose. The code is the stable machine identifier used by the dataset, the logs and the existing replication package; the descriptive name says who the counterparty actually is — for B2G these include regulators, the project-owning state-owned enterprise and the public, which 'business-to-government' does not convey. Both are kept as altLabel so neither reading is lost."@en,
        "도입국 행위자 주도 활동 제외 (`scope.importing_country_actor`). 제3자 NGO 제외 (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B는 폐기되었으며 G2G로 재배정한다 (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@ko,
        "수출측(export-side) 원전 수출 마케팅 활동만 코딩한다 (manual `scope.rule`). 채널은 행위 주체와 상대의 조합으로 결정된다."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf channel: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ01;CQ09" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=652; status=in_use" .

channel:G2G a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "government-to-government engagement"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (activity_type, observed_n=254, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:altLabel "G2G"@en ;
    skos:definition "Sovereign and export-support acts led by government. It includes the strategic industrial support that an exporting government provides to its own firms and state-owned enterprises (G2G-5)."@en,
        "정부가 주도하는 주권적 행위 및 수출지원 행위. 수출국 정부가 자국 기업·SOE에 제공하는 전략적 산업지원(G2G-5)을 포함한다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which representatives of the exporting government and of the host-country government hold talks with nuclear cooperation on the agenda and adopt a joint declaration."@en,
        "수출국 정부 대표와 도입국 정부 대표가 원자력 협력을 의제로 회담하고 공동선언을 채택한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme channel: ;
    skos:notation "G2G" ;
    skos:prefLabel "government-to-government engagement"@en,
        "정부 간 관여"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Excludes activities initiated by host-country actors (`scope.importing_country_actor`). Excludes third-party NGOs (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B has been retired and is reassigned to G2G (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@en,
        "Only export-side nuclear power plant export marketing activities are coded. The channel is determined by the combination of the acting party and the counterparty."@en,
        "도입국 행위자 주도 활동 제외 (`scope.importing_country_actor`). 제3자 NGO 제외 (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B는 폐기되었으며 G2G로 재배정한다 (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@ko,
        "수출측(export-side) 원전 수출 마케팅 활동만 코딩한다 (manual `scope.rule`). 채널은 행위 주체와 상대의 조합으로 결정된다."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf channel: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ01;CQ09" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=254; status=in_use" .

channel:Unknown a skos:Concept ;
