    skos:definition "Residual value used where the channel cannot be determined."@en,
        "채널을 판정할 수 없는 경우의 잔여 값."@ko ;
    skos:editorialNote "Permitted by the codebook but observed zero times in the dataset. It is kept so that codebook coverage stays complete."@en ;
    skos:example "A case coded with the residual value because the article contains no basis for determining the channel."@en,
        "채널을 판정할 근거가 기사에 없어 잔여 값으로 코딩한 경우."@ko ;
