    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Excludes activities initiated by host-country actors (`scope.importing_country_actor`). Excludes third-party NGOs (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B has been retired and is reassigned to G2G (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@en,
        "Only export-side nuclear power plant export marketing activities are coded. The channel is determined by the combination of the acting party and the counterparty."@en,
        "도입국 행위자 주도 활동 제외 (`scope.importing_country_actor`). 제3자 NGO 제외 (`scope.third_party_ngo`). G2B는 폐기되었으며 G2G로 재배정한다 (`scope.g2b_retired`, `g2b_redirect`)."@ko,
        "수출측(export-side) 원전 수출 마케팅 활동만 코딩한다 (manual `scope.rule`). 채널은 행위 주체와 상대의 조합으로 결정된다."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf channel: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ01;CQ09" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=0; status=allowed_unused" .

crole:host_firm a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "host-country firm"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (counterparty_role, observed_n=142, status=in_use)"@en ;
