        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "A firm of the host country, whether private or otherwise not the project owner."@en,
        "도입국의 기업(민간 또는 비사업주)."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a host-country firm becomes a contracting, supply or investment counterparty."@en,
        "도입국 기업으로서 계약·공급·투자 상대가 된 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme crole: ;
    skos:notation "host_firm" ;
    skos:prefLabel "host-country firm"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A project-owning state-owned enterprise is project_owner_soe."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "When the counterparty, as a host-country firm, is a contracting, supply or investment counterparty."@en,
        "사업주 국유기업은 project_owner_soe."@ko,
        "상대가 도입국 기업으로서 계약·공급·투자 상대일 때."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf crole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ03;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v1.0-draft; observed_n=142; status=in_use" .

