        "An administrative or regulatory counterparty is host_government or regulator."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "manual B2G-4 의 `requires_one_of` (public/community/media/social acceptance context) 를 충족하는 상대."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "행정·규제 상대는 host_government 또는 regulator."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf crole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ03;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v1.0-draft; observed_n=90; status=in_use" .

crole:regulator a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "regulator"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (counterparty_role, observed_n=28, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "A host-country body exercising formal authority such as licensing, review or competition oversight."@en,
        "인허가·심사·경쟁 감독 등 형식적 권한을 행사하는 도입국 기관."@ko ;
    skos:example "A licensing, review or competition oversight body. The source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) codes bid challenges addressed to a competition authority as B2G-2."@en,
        "인허가·심사·경쟁감독 기관. 매뉴얼은 경쟁당국에 대한 입찰 이의를 B2G-2 로 라우팅한다 (`lawsuit_against_regulator_or_antitrust_office`)."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme crole: ;
    skos:notation "regulator" ;
    skos:prefLabel "regulator"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Authority is defined by function, not by ownership: a body holds authority when it exercises responsibility for evaluation, licensing, approval or selection at the decision gateway in question."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "If the same organization acts as a contracting, investment or supply counterparty, it has a different role in that event."@en,
        "TERMINOLOGY_CROSSWALK.md: 권한은 소유가 아니라 기능으로 정의된다 — 해당 결정 관문에서 평가·인허가·승인·선정 책임을 행사할 때."@ko,
        "같은 조직이 계약·투자·공급 상대로 행위하면 그 사건에서는 다른 역할이다."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf crole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ03;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v1.0-draft; observed_n=28; status=in_use" .

eident:key_based a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "key-based"@en ;
    dcterms:source "evaluation/coding/v3.0/VALIDATION_PROTOCOL.md §2.5" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0027>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "A cluster identified with one engagement only because its records share the key of the clustering rule. No person's check has settled whether the records report one engagement: either no one checked, or the checks did not settle it."@en,
        "기록들이 군집 규칙의 키를 공유한다는 것만으로 관여 하나로 식별된 군집. 기록들이 한 관여를 보도하는지는 사람의 확인으로 정해지지 않았다 — 아무도 확인하지 않았거나, 확인이 그것을 정하지 못했다."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme eident: ;
    skos:notation "key_based" ;
    skos:prefLabel "key-based"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "The default in NuProc data: before the human validation every cluster is key-based"@en,
        "NuProc 자료의 기본값이다 — 사람 검증 전에는 모든 군집이 key_based 다"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf eident: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18" .

eident:merged a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "merged"@en ;
    dcterms:source "evaluation/coding/v3.0/VALIDATION_PROTOCOL.md §2.5" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "A cluster whose records a person has read and judged to report two or more engagements: the clustering rule brought different engagements together. Such a cluster does not report one engagement, so it has no reportsEngagement."@en,
        "사람이 군집의 기록들을 읽고 둘 이상의 관여를 보도한다고 판단한 군집 — 군집 규칙이 서로 다른 관여를 하나로 묶었다. 이 군집은 관여 하나를 보도하지 않으므로 reportsEngagement 를 갖지 않는다."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme eident: ;
    skos:notation "merged" ;
    skos:prefLabel "merged"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Because the data do not separate those engagements, no engagement individual is created: the real-world layer asserts only what the data identify. The cluster's coded values and role claims stay in the information layer; where its final occurrence status is occurred, as for every merged cluster in the NuProc data, its final role claims about a participation resolved to an organization support that organization's role in the case but yield no realization"@en,
        "자료가 그 관여들을 가르지 않으므로 관여 개체를 만들지 않는다 — 실세계 층은 자료가 식별한 것만 단언한다 (ADR-0040 §1). 군집의 코딩된 값 · 역할 주장은 정보 층에 그대로 남고, 최종 발생 상태가 occurred 이면 (NuProc 자료의 병합 군집은 모두 그렇다) 조직으로 해소된 참여에 관한 최종 역할 주장은 그 조직의 사례 수준 역할을 뒷받침하되 실현을 낳지 않는다 (ADR-0040 덧붙임 4 · ADR-0041 덧붙임 4 · 5)"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf eident: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18" .

eident:verified a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "verified"@en ;
    dcterms:source "evaluation/coding/v3.0/VALIDATION_PROTOCOL.md §2.5" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "A cluster whose records a person has read and judged to report one engagement. Whether that engagement took place is recorded by the occurrence status, not by this state."@en,
        "사람이 군집의 기록들을 읽고 한 관여를 보도한다고 판단한 군집. 그 관여가 일어났는지는 이 상태가 아니라 발생 상태가 적는다."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme eident: ;
    skos:notation "verified" ;
    skos:prefLabel "verified"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf eident: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18" .

erole:commercial_supply a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "commercial supply"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "The role of commercially supplying equipment, components or services other than the major equipment."@en,
        "주기기 이외의 기자재 · 부품 · 서비스를 상업적으로 공급하는 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "A component supplier discusses joining the local supply chain"@en,
        "부품사가 현지 공급망 참여를 논의한다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "commercial_supply" ;
    skos:prefLabel "commercial supply"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Supply of the reactor design or major equipment is technology_supply; winning an EPC contract is construction_contract."@en,
        "When the act concerns the supply of equipment, components or services other than the major equipment."@en,
        "노형 · 주기기 공급은 technology_supply, EPC 수주는 construction_contract."@ko,
        "행위가 주기기 이외의 기자재 · 부품 · 서비스 공급과 관련될 때."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:CommercialSupplyRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

erole:construction_contract a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "construction contract"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "The role of winning or performing an engineering, procurement and construction (EPC) contract."@en,
        "설계 · 조달 · 시공 (EPC) 을 수주하거나 수행하는 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "A construction firm negotiates its construction share in an EPC consortium"@en,
        "건설사가 EPC 컨소시엄의 시공 몫을 협상한다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "construction_contract" ;
    skos:prefLabel "construction contract"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Supply of the reactor design alone is technology_supply. If the actor also supplies the reactor design in the same event, both are recorded."@en,
        "When the act concerns an EPC contract, the scope of construction, a consortium's construction share or the construction supply chain."@en,
        "노형 공급만이면 technology_supply. 같은 사건에서 노형 공급도 맡으면 둘 다 적는다."@ko,
        "행위가 EPC 계약 · 시공 범위 · 컨소시엄의 시공 몫 · 건설 공급망과 관련될 때."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:ConstructionContractRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

erole:financing a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "financing"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "The role of providing or offering equity, financing or guarantees."@en,
        "지분 · 금융 · 보증을 제공하거나 제안하는 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "An export credit agency offers a financing package"@en,
        "수출신용기관이 금융 패키지를 제안한다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "financing" ;
    skos:prefLabel "financing"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Not recorded when financing is mentioned only as background and is not the actor's part."@en,
        "When public finance, export credit, an equity stake, financing terms or a guarantee is the actor's part in that event (even when the actor is a government)."@en,
        "공적금융 · 수출신용 · 지분참여 · 자금조달 조건 · 보증이 그 사건에서 행위자의 몫일 때 (정부가 하더라도)."@ko,
        "금융이 배경으로만 언급되고 행위자의 몫이 아니면 적지 않는다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:FinancingRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

erole:other a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "other"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "An export-side role for which the evidence shows none of the five roles above."@en,
        "위 다섯 가운데 어느 것도 근거에 없는 수출 측 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "An export-side body holds a training or promotional event"@en,
        "수출 측 기관이 교육 · 홍보 행사를 연다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "other" ;
    skos:prefLabel "other"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Only when none of the five applies: never used together with another value."@en,
        "When no judgement can be made, the event is marked '?', not other."@en,
        "다섯 가운데 어느 것도 없을 때만 — 다른 값과 함께 쓰지 않는다."@ko,
        "판단이 서지 않으면 other 가 아니라 '?' 로 표시한다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:OtherEngagementRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

erole:state_sponsorship a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "state sponsorship"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "The role of a government (a state body or an intergovernmental body) representing or sponsoring the export side."@en,
        "정부 (국가 기관 · 정부간 기구) 가 수출 측을 대표하거나 후원하는 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "A minister of the exporting country signs an intergovernmental memorandum of cooperation"@en,
        "수출국 장관이 정부간 협력 각서에 서명한다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "state_sponsorship" ;
    skos:prefLabel "state sponsorship"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Not recorded when the actor is not a government. Acting as a regulator or licensing authority is a counterparty role."@en,
        "When the actor is a government, a state body or an intergovernmental body and represents or sponsors the export side through political support, an intergovernmental agreement or support for its own industry."@en,
        "행위자가 정부 · 국가 기관 · 정부간 기구이고 정치적 지지 · 정부간 협정 · 자국 산업 지원으로 수출 측을 대표 · 후원할 때."@ko,
        "행위자가 정부가 아니면 적지 않는다. 규제 · 인허가 주체로서의 행위는 상대측 역할이다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:StateSponsorRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

erole:technology_supply a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "technology supply"@en ;
    dcterms:source "codebook v3.0" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0040> ;
    skos:definition "The role of proposing, negotiating or performing the supply of a reactor design or major equipment."@en,
        "원자로 노형 · 주기기의 공급을 제안 · 협상 · 수행하는 역할."@ko ;
    skos:example "A vendor proposes its reactor design and negotiates the supply terms"@en,
        "벤더가 노형을 제안하고 공급 조건을 협상한다"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme erole: ;
    skos:notation "technology_supply" ;
    skos:prefLabel "technology supply"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Single items of equipment other than the major equipment are commercial_supply. If the actor also takes on construction in the same event, construction_contract is recorded as well."@en,
        "When the act concerns a reactor design proposal, a supply contract, delivery of major equipment or technology transfer."@en,
        "주기기 이외 기자재 단품은 commercial_supply. 같은 사건에서 시공도 맡으면 construction_contract 도 함께 적는다."@ko,
        "행위가 노형 제안 · 공급 계약 · 주기기 납품 · 기술이전과 관련될 때."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf erole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02;CQ18" ;
    nuproc:roleClass nuproc:TechnologySupplyRole ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v3.0; frozen before coding on 2026-10-14" .

etype:B2B-1 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Deal structure & financial negotiation"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=82, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which firms and project organizations negotiate or settle the ownership and revenue structure of a project and its contractual terms. It includes equity structure negotiation, operatorship agreements, EPC contracts and decisions on BOO, BOT and BOOT arrangements, and it also covers commercial disputes between bidding firms, merger and acquisition disputes and shareholder disputes. Where the counterparty is the host-country project-owner state-owned enterprise, this code applies if that enterprise acts as a contracting, investment or supply party; if it acts at an evaluation or selection gateway it is B2G-2. A bid challenge addressed to a regulator is B2G-2, an intellectual property or technology-transfer dispute is B2B-4, and forming an alliance is B2B-3."@en,
        "기업·사업조직 사이에서 사업의 소유·수익 구조와 계약 조건을 협상하거나 확정하는 활동. 지분구조 협상, 운영권 계약, EPC 계약, BOO·BOT·BOOT 방식 결정을 포함하며, 입찰 참여사 간 상업분쟁, 인수합병 분쟁, 주주 분쟁도 이에 속한다. 상대가 도입국 사업주 SOE인 경우에도 그 SOE가 계약·투자·공급 당사자로 행위하면 이 코드이며, 평가·선정 관문에서 행위하면 B2G-2이다. 규제기관을 상대로 한 입찰 이의는 B2G-2, 지식재산·기술이전 분쟁은 B2B-4, 제휴 형성은 B2B-3이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which an equity structure or operating rights are negotiated or an EPC contract is concluded. It includes commercial disputes between bidding firms."@en,
        "지분 구조나 운영권을 협상하거나 EPC 계약을 체결한 경우. 입찰 참여사 간 상업 분쟁을 포함한다."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2B-1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Deal structure & financial negotiation"@en,
        "거래 구조 및 금융 협상"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "tender_appeal_to_government_regulator → B2G-2 | ip_or_tech_transfer_dispute → B2B-4 | strategic_alliance → B2B-3",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: equity_structure_negotiation, operation_rights_agreement, epc_contract_or_agreement, boo_bot_boot_model, inter_bidder_commercial_dispute, m_and_a_dispute, shareholder_dispute"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: equity_structure_negotiation, operation_rights_agreement, epc_contract_or_agreement, boo_bot_boot_model, inter_bidder_commercial_dispute, m_and_a_dispute, shareholder_dispute"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=82; status=in_use" .

etype:B2B-2 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Technology demonstration & differentiation"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=21, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a firm demonstrates and explains the performance and distinctiveness of its own technology to a potential customer or business partner. It includes technical design proposals, performance demonstrations, support for reactor-type selection, and sharing of reference plant operating experience. Technology transfer that has led to a contract is B2B-4, and forming an alliance or consortium is B2B-3."@en,
        "기업이 잠재 고객이나 사업 파트너를 상대로 자사 기술의 성능과 차별성을 입증·설명하는 활동. 기술설계 제안, 성능 시연, 노형 선정 지원, 기준플랜트 운전실적 공유를 포함한다. 계약으로 이어진 기술이전은 B2B-4, 제휴·컨소시엄 형성은 B2B-3이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor demonstrates the performance of a reactor type to a potential customer or shares the operating record of a reference plant."@en,
        "벤더가 잠재 고객에게 노형 성능을 시연하거나 기준플랜트 운전 실적을 공유한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2B-2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Technology demonstration & differentiation"@en,
        "기술 시연 및 차별화"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "tech_transfer_contract → B2B-4 | alliance_or_consortium_formation → B2B-3",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: technical_design_proposal_to_potential_customer, performance_demonstration, reactor_type_selection_support, reference_plant_operational_data_sharing"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: technical_design_proposal_to_potential_customer, performance_demonstration, reactor_type_selection_support, reference_plant_operational_data_sharing"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=21; status=in_use" .

etype:B2B-3 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Alliance & supply-chain formation"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=165, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which firms and project organizations form cooperative relationships and supply-chain structures. It includes establishing joint ventures, forming consortia, strategic alliances, local procurement partnerships and expressions of intent to cooperate. Settling a specific transaction structure is B2B-1, a technology transfer contract is B2B-4, and cooperation at government level is G2G-2."@en,
        "기업·사업조직 사이에서 협력 관계와 공급망 구조를 형성하는 활동. 합작법인 설립, 컨소시엄 구성, 전략적 제휴, 현지 조달 파트너십, 협력 의향 표명을 포함한다. 구체적 거래 구조 확정은 B2B-1, 기술이전 계약은 B2B-4, 정부 차원 협력은 G2G-2이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a joint venture or consortium is formed or a local procurement partnership is concluded."@en,
        "합작법인이나 컨소시엄을 구성하거나 현지 조달 파트너십을 체결한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2B-3" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Alliance & supply-chain formation"@en,
        "제휴 및 공급망 형성"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "concrete_deal_structuring → B2B-1 | tech_transfer_contract → B2B-4 | government_level_cooperation → G2G-2",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: joint_venture_formation, consortium_formation, strategic_alliance, local_procurement_partnership, expressed_interest_in_cooperation"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: joint_venture_formation, consortium_formation, strategic_alliance, local_procurement_partnership, expressed_interest_in_cooperation"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=165; status=in_use" .

etype:B2B-4 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Tech transfer, O&M & lifecycle services (incl. IP disputes)"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=36, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which firms and project organizations contract for and carry out the transfer of technology itself and plant life-cycle services. It includes technology transfer contracts, operator training programmes, operations and maintenance contracts, fuel supply, waste management and decommissioning, and it also covers copyright and patent disputes and arbitration proceedings. Technology transfer at government level is G2G-3 or G2G-4, pre-contract demonstration is B2B-2, and a procurement dispute against a regulator is B2G-2."@en,
        "기업·사업조직 사이에서 기술 자체의 이전과 발전소 생애주기 서비스를 계약·수행하는 활동. 기술이전 계약, 운전요원 훈련 프로그램, 운영·정비 계약, 연료 공급, 폐기물 관리, 해체를 포함하며, 저작권·특허 분쟁과 중재 절차도 이에 속한다. 정부 차원의 기술이전은 G2G-3 또는 G2G-4, 계약 이전 단계의 시연은 B2B-2, 규제기관 상대 조달 분쟁은 B2G-2이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a technology transfer contract, operator training, or a fuel supply and maintenance contract is concluded. It includes patent and copyright disputes."@en,
        "기술이전 계약, 운영요원 훈련, 연료공급·정비 계약을 체결한 경우. 특허·저작권 분쟁을 포함한다."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2B-4" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tech transfer, O&M & lifecycle services (incl. IP disputes)"@en,
        "기술이전, 운영·정비 (IP 분쟁 포함)"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "government_level_tech_transfer → G2G-3_or_G2G-4 | pre_contract_demo → B2B-2 | procurement_dispute_vs_regulator → B2G-2",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: technology_transfer_contract, operator_training_program, o_and_m_contract, fuel_supply, waste_management, decommissioning, copyright_or_patent_dispute, arbitration_tribunal_proceeding"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: technology_transfer_contract, operator_training_program, o_and_m_contract, fuel_supply, waste_management, decommissioning, copyright_or_patent_dispute, arbitration_tribunal_proceeding"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=36; status=in_use" .

etype:B2B-Other a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Other business-to-business activity"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=0, status=allowed_unused)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "Residual code for a business-to-business activity that, after the interpretation procedure, falls under none of B2B-1 to B2B-4."@en,
        "B2B-1 B2B-2 B2B-3 B2B-4에 분류되지 않는 기타 B2B"@ko ;
    skos:editorialNote "Permitted by the codebook but observed zero times in the dataset. It is kept so that codebook coverage stays complete."@en ;
    skos:example "A case in which the channel is clearly B2B but none of B2B-1~4 applies, so it is handled with the residual code."@en,
        "채널은 B2B 로 명확하나 B2B-1~4 어디에도 해당하지 않아 잔여 코드로 처리한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2B-Other" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other business-to-business activity"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Condition of use: B2B channel is clear but B2B-1..B2B-4 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Derived from the structure of the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) — condition of use: B2B channel is clear but B2B-1..B2B-4 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "매뉴얼 구조에서 도출 — 사용 조건: B2B channel is clear but B2B-1..B2B-4 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "사용 조건: B2B channel is clear but B2B-1..B2B-4 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=0; status=allowed_unused" .

etype:B2G-1 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Strategic engagement & market shaping"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=203, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a firm builds market conditions and relationships with the host government and its authorities at a stage before the formal procurement procedure. It includes early market entry, market shaping, policy briefings to the host government, value propositions at ministerial level, pre-feasibility work and strategic relationship building. Responding to a formal tender is B2G-2, a financing or localisation proposal is B2G-3, and public acceptance activity is B2G-4."@en,
        "기업이 도입국 정부·당국을 상대로 공식 조달 절차 이전 단계에서 시장 환경과 관계를 형성하는 활동. 조기 시장진입, 시장 형성, 도입국 정부 대상 정책 브리핑, 장관급 대상 가치제안, 사전 타당성 검토, 전략적 관계 구축을 포함한다. 공식 입찰 대응은 B2G-2, 금융·현지화 제안은 B2G-3, 사회적 수용성 활동은 B2G-4이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor presents the value proposition of its own reactor type to ministerial-level officials of the host country, or proposes a pre-feasibility study."@en,
        "벤더가 도입국 장관급을 대상으로 자사 노형의 가치제안을 설명하거나 사전 타당성 검토를 제안한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2G-1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Strategic engagement & market shaping"@en,
        "전략적 영업 및 시장 형성"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "formal_tender_response → B2G-2 | financing_or_localization_proposal → B2G-3 | public_social_acceptance_activity → B2G-4",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: early_market_entry, market_shaping, policy_briefing_to_importing_government, value_proposition_to_ministers, pre_feasibility_study, strategic_relationship_building"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: early_market_entry, market_shaping, policy_briefing_to_importing_government, value_proposition_to_ministers, pre_feasibility_study, strategic_relationship_building"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=203; status=in_use" .

etype:B2G-2 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Procurement & regulatory response (incl. tender appeals)"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=280, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a firm formally responds to a host country's procurement or regulatory procedure. It includes responses to pre-qualification and requests for proposals, bid submission, technical and price proposals, licence and permit applications, and submission of regulatory compliance documents, and it also covers procurement disputes such as bid challenges and litigation or injunctions against regulators and competition authorities. A response addressed to the host-country project-owner state-owned enterprise also takes this code where that enterprise acts at an evaluation, licensing, approval or selection gateway. Because authority is determined by function rather than by ownership, the same enterprise acting as a contracting, investment or supply counterparty is B2B-1."@en,
        "기업이 도입국의 조달 절차나 규제 절차에 공식적으로 대응하는 활동. PQ·RFP 응답, 입찰서 제출, 기술제안, 가격제안, 인허가·허가 신청, 규제 준수 서류 제출을 포함하며, 입찰 이의제기와 규제기관·경쟁당국을 상대로 한 소송·가처분 등 조달 분쟁도 이에 속한다. 도입국 사업주 SOE를 상대로 한 대응도 그 SOE가 평가·인허가·승인·선정 관문에서 행위할 때 이 코드로 배정한다. 권한은 소유가 아니라 기능으로 판정하므로, 같은 SOE라도 계약·투자·공급 상대로 행위하면 B2B-1이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor submits a technical proposal and a price offer in response to the procuring entity's RFP, or lodges a challenge against the tender result with the competition authority."@en,
        "벤더가 발주처의 RFP 에 기술제안서와 가격제안을 제출하거나, 입찰 결과에 대해 경쟁당국에 이의를 제기한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2G-2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Procurement & regulatory response (incl. tender appeals)"@en,
        "조달 및 규제 응답 (입찰 항의 포함)"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Firm bid/RFP/licensing/procurement response to importing-country project-owner SOE routes to B2G-2."@en,
        "Included activities: pq_response, rfp_response, bid_submission, technical_proposal, price_offer, licensing_application, permit_application, regulatory_compliance_document, tender_appeal, lawsuit_against_regulator_or_antitrust_office, preliminary_injunction_in_procurement_dispute"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: pq_response, rfp_response, bid_submission, technical_proposal, price_offer, licensing_application, permit_application, regulatory_compliance_document, tender_appeal, lawsuit_against_regulator_or_antitrust_office, preliminary_injunction_in_procurement_dispute"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=280; status=in_use" .

etype:B2G-3 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Financing & localization proposal"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=88, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a firm proposes or commits financing terms or local industrial participation to the host government or its authorities. It includes firm-level financing terms, risk-sharing arrangements, localisation commitments, technology-transfer undertakings given to a government, and industrial participation programmes, and it carries an economic element tag. Financing at government level is G2G-3."@en,
        "기업이 도입국 정부·당국을 상대로 자금 조달 조건이나 현지 산업 참여를 제안·약정하는 활동. 기업 차원의 금융 조건, 리스크 분담 방안, 현지화 약속, 정부를 상대로 한 기술이전 약정, 산업참여 프로그램을 포함하며 경제적 요소 태그를 수반한다. 정부 차원의 금융은 G2G-3이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor proposes financing terms, risk sharing and localisation implementation to the host government."@en,
        "벤더가 도입국 정부에 금융 조건, 리스크 분담, 현지화 이행을 제안한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2G-3" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Financing & localization proposal"@en,
        "금융 및 현지화 제안"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "government_level_financing → G2G-3",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: firm_financing_terms, risk_sharing_arrangement, localization_commitment, tech_transfer_commitment_to_government, industrial_participation_program | Requirement: secondary economic tag required"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: firm_financing_terms, risk_sharing_arrangement, localization_commitment, tech_transfer_commitment_to_government, industrial_participation_program | 요건: secondary economic tag 필요"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=88; status=in_use" .

etype:B2G-4 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Public communication & social acceptance"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=78, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "A communication activity carried out by a firm towards the public and local communities in order to obtain understanding of and acceptance for a project. It includes residents' briefings, company-hosted public hearings, information campaigns aimed at local residents, trust building in the siting community, and crisis communication. At least one of a public, community, media or social-acceptance context must be confirmed and a policy_target must be recorded. General predicates such as 'announced' or 'stressed' do not displace B2G-2 or B2G-3 where tender, procurement, financing or localisation cues are present."@en,
        "기업이 공중·지역사회를 대상으로 사업에 대한 이해와 수용을 얻기 위해 수행하는 소통 활동. 주민설명회, 기업 주최 공청회, 지역주민 대상 정보 캠페인, 입지 지역사회 신뢰 구축, 위기 커뮤니케이션을 포함한다. 공중·지역사회·미디어·사회적 수용성 맥락 중 하나 이상이 확인되고 policy_target 이 기재되어야 한다. '발표했다·강조했다' 같은 일반적 서술어는 입찰·조달·금융·현지화 단서가 있을 때 B2G-2·B2G-3를 대체하지 못한다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which a vendor holds a briefing for residents near the site or carries out an information campaign."@en,
        "벤더가 부지 인근 주민을 대상으로 설명회를 열거나 정보 캠페인을 수행한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2G-4" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Public communication & social acceptance"@en,
        "공중 소통 및 사회적 수용성"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Broad verbs such as presented, demonstrated, highlighted, emphasized, or press release do not override B2G-2/B2G-3 when tender/procurement/financing/localization cues are present."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: townhall_meeting, public_hearing_sponsored_by_firm, information_campaign_to_local_residents, host_community_trust_building, crisis_communication | Requirements (at least one): public_context, community_context, media_context, social_acceptance_context | Mandatory field: policy_target"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: townhall_meeting, public_hearing_sponsored_by_firm, information_campaign_to_local_residents, host_community_trust_building, crisis_communication | 요건(하나 이상): public_context, community_context, media_context, social_acceptance_context | 필수 필드: policy_target"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=78; status=in_use" .

etype:B2G-Other a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Other business-to-government activity"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=3, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "Residual code assigned to an activity that is clearly in the B2G channel but, after the interpretation procedure, falls under none of B2G-1 to B2G-4."@en,
        "채널이 B2G 임은 분명하나 해석 절차를 거친 뒤에도 B2G-1~B2G-4 중 어디에도 해당하지 않는 활동에 부여하는 잔여 코드."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which the channel is clearly B2G but none of B2G-1~4 applies, so it is handled with the residual code."@en,
        "채널은 B2G 로 명확하나 B2G-1~4 어디에도 해당하지 않아 잔여 코드로 처리한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "B2G-Other" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other business-to-government activity"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Condition of use: B2G channel is clear but B2G-1..B2G-4 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Derived from the structure of the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) — condition of use: B2G channel is clear but B2G-1..B2G-4 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "매뉴얼 구조에서 도출 — 사용 조건: B2G channel is clear but B2G-1..B2G-4 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "사용 조건: B2G channel is clear but B2G-1..B2G-4 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=3; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-1 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "High-level diplomacy & political support"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=87, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a government expresses and conveys political support for, and willingness to cooperate on, a nuclear project through high-level contact or a public statement of position. Summits and ministerial meetings, special envoys, joint statements, strategic partnership declarations and outward-facing trade missions belong here. This code applies where the outcome remains a statement of position or intent; if it establishes or modifies institutions or norms it is G2G-2, if it is a specific public financing commitment it is G2G-3, and if it is capacity-building support it is G2G-4."@en,
        "정부가 고위급 접촉이나 공개 의사표시를 통해 원전 사업에 대한 정치적 지지와 협력 의사를 표명·전달하는 활동. 정상·장관급 회담, 특사 파견, 공동성명, 전략적 동반자 선언, 대외 무역사절단이 이에 속한다. 결과물이 입장·의사 표명에 머무는 경우가 이 코드이며, 제도·규범의 수립·변경으로 이어지면 G2G-2, 구체적 공적금융 확약이면 G2G-3, 역량구축 지원이면 G2G-4이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "Public milestone examples (compiled by the author, not corpus records): President Macron state visit to Prague ; Czech–French Strategic Partnership Action Plan 2024–2028 backing EDF (France, 2024-03)"@en,
        "공개 마일스톤 예 (저자 편찬, 코퍼스 기록 아님): President Macron state visit to Prague ; Czech–French Strategic Partnership Action Plan 2024–2028 backing EDF (France, 2024-03)"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-1" ;
    skos:prefLabel "High-level diplomacy & political support"@en,
        "고위급 외교 및 정치적 지원"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "formal_agreement_or_mou → G2G-2 | specific_public_financing → G2G-3 | capacity_building_or_training → G2G-4",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: summit, presidential_or_prime_ministerial_visit, ministerial_meeting, special_envoy, joint_statement, strategic_partnership_declaration, bilateral_consultation, export_government_information_sharing_with_foreign_firms, external_facing_trade_mission_or_supply_chain_forum"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: summit, presidential_or_prime_ministerial_visit, ministerial_meeting, special_envoy, joint_statement, strategic_partnership_declaration, bilateral_consultation, export_government_information_sharing_with_foreign_firms, external_facing_trade_mission_or_supply_chain_forum"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=87; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-2 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Institutional / regulatory framework"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=44, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which a government establishes or modifies the legal and regulatory basis for nuclear cooperation or for a project. It covers bilateral instruments such as intergovernmental agreements and MoUs, 123 and peaceful-uses agreements, non-proliferation and safeguards commitments, and frameworks for regulatory and licensing cooperation, and it also covers unilateral institutional and regulatory acts such as designating a project as nationally important, setting procurement security standards and establishing a licensing regime. This code applies where the outcome is a document, an institution or a standard; where it remains an expression of support or intervention it is G2G-1."@en,
        "정부가 원자력 협력 또는 사업의 법적·규제적 기반을 수립하거나 변경하는 활동. 정부 간 협정과 MoU, 123협정·평화적이용협정, 핵비확산·안전조치 약속, 규제·인허가 협력 체계의 설정 등 양자 문서를 포함하며, 국가적 중요사업 지정, 조달 보안기준 설정, 인허가 체계 수립 등 일방적 제도·규제 행위도 이에 속한다(ADR-0006). 결과물이 문서·제도·기준이면 이 코드이고, 지지·개입 등 의사표시에 그치면 G2G-1이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "Public milestone examples (compiled by the author, not corpus records): US–Poland Intergovernmental Agreement (IGA) on civil nuclear cooperation signed (United States, 2020-10) ; US–Bulgaria Strategic Civil Nuclear Cooperation MoU (NCMOU) (United States, 2020-09)"@en,
        "공개 마일스톤 예 (저자 편찬, 코퍼스 기록 아님): US–Poland Intergovernmental Agreement (IGA) on civil nuclear cooperation signed (United States, 2020-10) ; US–Bulgaria Strategic Civil Nuclear Cooperation MoU (NCMOU) (United States, 2020-09)"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-2" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Institutional / regulatory framework"@en,
        "제도·규제 프레임워크"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Derived from the structure of the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) — cases where the boundary rule of G2G-1 is 'formal_agreement_or_mou' are sent to this code → conversely, where that condition does not hold, G2G-1 | cases where the boundary rule of B2B-3 is 'government_level_cooperation' are sent to this code → conversely, where that condition does not hold, B2B-3"@en,
        "Included activities: bilateral_mou, intergovernmental_agreement, 123_agreement, peaceful_uses_agreement, safeguards, nonproliferation_commitment, regulatory_cooperation, nuclear_safety_mou, licensing_cooperation_framework"@en,
        "매뉴얼 구조에서 도출 — G2G-1 의 경계 규칙이 'formal_agreement_or_mou' 인 경우를 이 코드로 보낸다 → 역으로 해당 조건이 아니면 G2G-1 | B2B-3 의 경계 규칙이 'government_level_cooperation' 인 경우를 이 코드로 보낸다 → 역으로 해당 조건이 아니면 B2B-3"@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: bilateral_mou, intergovernmental_agreement, 123_agreement, peaceful_uses_agreement, safeguards, nonproliferation_commitment, regulatory_cooperation, nuclear_safety_mou, licensing_cooperation_framework"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=44; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-3 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Public financing & industrial cooperation"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=57, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "An activity in which an exporting government or public body commits public funds or guarantees to a host-country project, or agrees industrial cooperation at government level. It includes sovereign loans, export credit agency financing, government and sovereign guarantees, EXIM, DFC and KEXIM commitments, and government-level localisation and industrial cooperation MoUs, and it carries an economic element tag. A financing proposal made by a firm is B2G-3."@en,
        "수출국 정부 또는 공적기관이 도입국 사업에 공적 재원·보증을 투입하거나 정부 차원의 산업협력을 약정하는 활동. 국가 차관, 수출신용기관 금융, 정부·주권 보증, EXIM·DFC·KEXIM 확약, 정부 수준의 현지화·산업협력 MoU를 포함하며 경제적 요소 태그를 수반한다. 기업이 주체인 금융 제안은 B2G-3이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "Public milestone examples (compiled by the author, not corpus records): US EXIM Bank USD 8.6bn Letter of Interest and financing meeting with Bulgaria's energy minister (United States, 2025-02) ; US EXIM Bank engagement on Kozloduy 7&8 financing structure (United States, 2024-05)"@en,
        "공개 마일스톤 예 (저자 편찬, 코퍼스 기록 아님): US EXIM Bank USD 8.6bn Letter of Interest and financing meeting with Bulgaria's energy minister (United States, 2025-02) ; US EXIM Bank engagement on Kozloduy 7&8 financing structure (United States, 2024-05)"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-3" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Public financing & industrial cooperation"@en,
        "공적금융 및 산업 협력"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "firm_level_financing_proposal → B2G-3",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: sovereign_loan, eca_financing, government_guarantee, sovereign_guarantee, exim_commitment, dfc_commitment, kexim_commitment, government_level_localization_mou, government_level_industrial_cooperation | Requirement: secondary economic tag required"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: sovereign_loan, eca_financing, government_guarantee, sovereign_guarantee, exim_commitment, dfc_commitment, kexim_commitment, government_level_localization_mou, government_level_industrial_cooperation | 요건: secondary economic tag 필요"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=57; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-4 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Capacity building & readiness"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=12, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "A support activity carried out by an exporting government to raise the host country's capability and institutional readiness for nuclear new build. It includes government-level workforce training, IAEA INIR readiness assessment, roadmap and institutional design support, research and development cooperation, and government-funded scholarships and training. Firm-to-firm training or technology transfer is B2B-4, and a specific licensing application is B2G-2."@en,
        "수출국 정부가 도입국의 원전 도입 역량과 제도적 준비도를 높이기 위해 수행하는 지원 활동. 정부 차원 인력양성, IAEA INIR 준비도 평가, 로드맵·제도설계 지원, 연구개발 협력, 정부 재원 장학·훈련을 포함한다. 기업 간 훈련·기술이전은 B2B-4, 구체적 인허가 신청은 B2G-2이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "Public milestone examples (compiled by the author, not corpus records): USTDA grant to PEJ for AP1000 FEED study (State Dept + DOE co-funded) (United States, 2021-06) ; USTDA grant agreements for Bulgarian nuclear projects (SMR study + used-fuel disposal study) (United States, 2024-12)"@en,
        "공개 마일스톤 예 (저자 편찬, 코퍼스 기록 아님): USTDA grant to PEJ for AP1000 FEED study (State Dept + DOE co-funded) (United States, 2021-06) ; USTDA grant agreements for Bulgarian nuclear projects (SMR study + used-fuel disposal study) (United States, 2024-12)"@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-4" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Capacity building & readiness"@en,
        "역량 구축 및 준비도"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "firm_to_firm_training_or_tech_transfer → B2B-4 | specific_licensing_application → B2G-2",
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Included activities: workforce_training_government_level, iaea_inir_readiness_assessment, roadmap_support, institutional_design_assistance, r_and_d_cooperation, export_government_scholarship, government_funded_training"@en,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: workforce_training_government_level, iaea_inir_readiness_assessment, roadmap_support, institutional_design_assistance, r_and_d_cooperation, export_government_scholarship, government_funded_training"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=12; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-5 a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Strategic industry support"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=54, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "Domestic industrial support that an exporting government provides to its own firms or state-owned enterprises in order to underpin nuclear export capability. It includes research and development subsidies to domestic nuclear firms, national R&D programmes underpinning exports, export credit and guarantees for domestic firms, and support to the domestic supply chain for export. It applies only where the actor is the exporting government, the counterparty is a firm or state-owned enterprise of that same exporting country, and the evidence of support for a domestic strategic industry are all confirmed."@en,
        "수출국 정부가 자국 기업 또는 자국 SOE를 대상으로 원전 수출 역량을 뒷받침하기 위해 제공하는 국내 산업지원. 자국 원자력 기업에 대한 R&D 보조, 수출을 뒷받침하는 국가 R&D 사업, 자국 기업에 대한 수출신용·보증, 수출용 국내 공급망 지원을 포함한다. 행위자가 수출국 정부이고 상대가 같은 수출국의 기업·SOE이며 자국 전략산업 지원이라는 근거가 모두 확인될 때만 적용한다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A case in which an exporting government provides domestic R&D subsidies or export credit aimed at the exports of its own nuclear firms."@en,
        "수출국 정부가 자국 원자력 기업의 수출을 겨냥해 국내 R&D 보조나 수출신용을 제공한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-5" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Strategic industry support"@en,
        "전략 산업 지원"@ko ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Derived from the structure of the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) — unless all of the following are met, it is not this code: actor_is_exporting_country_government, counterparty_is_same_exporting_country_firm_or_soe, evidence_has_domestic_own_national_strategic_industry_support"@en,
        "Included activities: domestic_r_and_d_subsidy_for_own_nuclear_firm, national_r_and_d_program_supporting_nuclear_exports, export_credit_or_guarantee_to_own_firm, domestic_supply_chain_support_for_export | Requirements (all must be met): actor_is_exporting_country_government, counterparty_is_same_exporting_country_firm_or_soe, evidence_has_domestic_own_national_strategic_industry_support"@en,
        "매뉴얼 구조에서 도출 — 다음을 모두 충족하지 않으면 이 코드가 아니다: actor_is_exporting_country_government, counterparty_is_same_exporting_country_firm_or_soe, evidence_has_domestic_own_national_strategic_industry_support"@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko,
        "포함 활동: domestic_r_and_d_subsidy_for_own_nuclear_firm, national_r_and_d_program_supporting_nuclear_exports, export_credit_or_guarantee_to_own_firm, domestic_supply_chain_support_for_export | 요건(전부 충족): actor_is_exporting_country_government, counterparty_is_same_exporting_country_firm_or_soe, evidence_has_domestic_own_national_strategic_industry_support"@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=54; status=in_use" .

etype:G2G-Other a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Other government-to-government activity"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (primary_code, observed_n=0, status=allowed_unused)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "Residual code for a government-to-government activity that, after the interpretation procedure, falls under none of G2G-1 to G2G-5."@en,
        "G2G-1 G2G-2 G2G-3 G2G-4 G2G-5에 분류되지 않는 기타 G2G"@ko ;
    skos:editorialNote "Permitted by the codebook but observed zero times in the dataset. It is kept so that codebook coverage stays complete."@en ;
    skos:example "A case in which the channel is clearly G2G but none of G2G-1~5 applies, so it is handled with the residual code."@en,
        "채널은 G2G 로 명확하나 G2G-1~5 어디에도 해당하지 않아 잔여 코드로 처리한 경우."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme etype: ;
    skos:notation "G2G-Other" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Other government-to-government activity"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Condition of use: G2G channel is clear but G2G-1..G2G-5 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "Derived from the structure of the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) — condition of use: G2G channel is clear but G2G-1..G2G-5 do not match after resolver."@en,
        "매뉴얼 구조에서 도출 — 사용 조건: G2G channel is clear but G2G-1..G2G-5 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "사용 조건: G2G channel is clear but G2G-1..G2G-5 do not match after resolver."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf etype: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ10;CQ11" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=0; status=allowed_unused" .

etype:Unknown a skos:Concept ;
