    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v2.6.5c; observed_n=0; status=allowed_unused" .

ostat:denied a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "denied"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_occurrence_v1.csv; evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/CODING_PROTOCOL.md §2"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0041> ;
    skos:definition "The records of the cluster report that the engagement did not take place."@en,
        "그 군집의 기록들이 그 관여가 일어나지 않았다고 보도한다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A report that a planned visit was cancelled."@en,
        "예정된 방문이 취소됐다는 보도."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme ostat: ;
    skos:notation "denied" ;
    skos:prefLabel "denied"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A cluster with this value, and its records, report no engagement. The cluster's role claims stay claims and ground no role, and its participation yields no side role. This is a rule for asserting roles, not a condition of their existence: a role can exist before any engagement takes place, but the report of an engagement not stated to have taken place is not taken as evidence for it."@en,
        "If it conflicts with a report that the engagement took place, the value is unclear."@en,
        "Reports a cancellation, a collapse, a postponement so that it did not take place, or a denial by a party, and no report that it took place."@en,
        "이 값의 군집과 그 기록은 관여를 보도하지 않는다. 그 군집의 역할 주장은 주장으로 남고 역할의 근거가 되지 않으며, 그 참여는 측 역할을 낳지 않는다. 역할을 단언하는 규칙이지 역할이 있기 위한 조건이 아니다: 역할은 관여가 일어나기 전에도 있을 수 있지만, 일어났다고 보도되지 않은 관여의 보도를 그 근거로 삼지 않는다 (ADR-0041 덧붙임 4 · 5)"@ko,
        "일어났다는 보도와 엇갈리면 unclear 다."@ko,
        "취소 · 무산 · 연기로 열리지 않음 · 당사자의 부인을 보도하고, 일어났다는 보도가 없다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf ostat: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18;CQ20" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook occurrence_v1; frozen before coding on 2026-10-15" .

ostat:occurred a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "occurred"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_occurrence_v1.csv; evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/CODING_PROTOCOL.md §2"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0041> ;
    skos:definition "The engagement reported by the records of the cluster had taken place, or was under way, when it was reported."@en,
        "그 군집의 기록들이 보도하는 관여가, 보도된 시점에, 일어났거나 진행 중이다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A report that the representatives of the two countries met and issued a joint statement."@en,
        "양국 대표가 회담하고 공동성명을 냈다는 보도."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme ostat: ;
    skos:notation "occurred" ;
    skos:prefLabel "occurred"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "An engagement is asserted in the real-world layer only for a cluster whose final value is this one and that is not merged"@en,
        "At least one excerpt reports as fact that the engagement took place or is under way (a meeting was held, an agreement was signed, a visit was made, a bid was submitted, negotiations are under way, an announcement was made)."@en,
        "If another excerpt of the same cluster states that the engagement did not take place (a denial or a cancellation), the value is unclear."@en,
        "같은 군집의 다른 발췌가 그 관여가 일어나지 않았다고 명시하면 (부인 · 취소) unclear 로 한다."@ko,
        "실세계 층의 관여는 최종 값이 이것이고 병합되지 않은 군집에만 단언한다 (ADR-0041 §2)"@ko,
        "적어도 한 발췌가 그 관여가 일어났다 또는 진행 중이라고 사실로 보도한다 (회의가 열렸다 · 서명했다 · 방문했다 · 제출했다 · 협상이 진행 중이다 · 발표했다)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf ostat: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18;CQ20" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook occurrence_v1; frozen before coding on 2026-10-15" .

ostat:planned a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "planned"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_occurrence_v1.csv; evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/CODING_PROTOCOL.md §2"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0041> ;
    skos:definition "The records of the cluster report the engagement only as something still to come."@en,
        "그 군집의 기록들이 그 관여를 앞으로의 일로만 보도한다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A report that a signing is scheduled for next month."@en,
        "다음 달 서명할 예정이라는 보도."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme ostat: ;
    skos:notation "planned" ;
    skos:prefLabel "planned"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A cluster with this value, and its records, report no engagement. The cluster's role claims stay claims and ground no role, and its participation yields no side role. This is a rule for asserting roles, not a condition of their existence: a role can exist before any engagement takes place, but the report of an engagement not stated to have taken place is not taken as evidence for it."@en,
        "If there is even one factual report that it took place, the value is occurred."@en,
        "The excerpts report it only as scheduled, agreed, invited, planned, intended or timetabled, with no report that it took place and no cancellation or denial."@en,
        "발췌가 예정 · 합의 · 초청 · 계획 · 의향 · 일정으로만 보도하고, 일어났다는 보도도 취소 · 부인도 없다."@ko,
        "이 값의 군집과 그 기록은 관여를 보도하지 않는다. 그 군집의 역할 주장은 주장으로 남고 역할의 근거가 되지 않으며, 그 참여는 측 역할을 낳지 않는다. 역할을 단언하는 규칙이지 역할이 있기 위한 조건이 아니다: 역할은 관여가 일어나기 전에도 있을 수 있지만, 일어났다고 보도되지 않은 관여의 보도를 그 근거로 삼지 않는다 (ADR-0041 덧붙임 4 · 5)"@ko,
        "일어났다는 사실 보도가 하나라도 있으면 occurred 다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf ostat: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18;CQ20" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook occurrence_v1; frozen before coding on 2026-10-15" .

ostat:unclear a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "unclear"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_occurrence_v1.csv; evaluation/coding/occurrence_v1/CODING_PROTOCOL.md §2"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0041> ;
    skos:definition "The excerpts do not allow one to tell whether the engagement took place, is planned or was denied."@en,
        "발췌로는 그 관여가 일어났는지 · 예정인지 · 부인됐는지 가를 수 없다."@ko ;
    skos:example "A report that only says, quoting officials, that a meeting may have taken place."@en,
        "관계자를 인용해 회담이 있었을 수 있다고만 전하는 보도."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme ostat: ;
    skos:notation "unclear" ;
    skos:prefLabel "unclear"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A cluster with this value, and its records, report no engagement. The cluster's role claims stay claims and ground no role, and its participation yields no side role. This is a rule for asserting roles, not a condition of their existence: a role can exist before any engagement takes place, but the report of an engagement not stated to have taken place is not taken as evidence for it."@en,
        "Do not force a case into occurred because no judgement can be reached."@en,
        "Rumour, speculation, a conditional statement, an unsourced claim, or excerpts that conflict (took place / denied)."@en,
        "소문 · 추측 · 조건부 진술 · 출처를 밝히지 않은 주장, 또는 발췌끼리 엇갈린다 (일어났다 / 부인)."@ko,
        "이 값의 군집과 그 기록은 관여를 보도하지 않는다. 그 군집의 역할 주장은 주장으로 남고 역할의 근거가 되지 않으며, 그 참여는 측 역할을 낳지 않는다. 역할을 단언하는 규칙이지 역할이 있기 위한 조건이 아니다: 역할은 관여가 일어나기 전에도 있을 수 있지만, 일어났다고 보도되지 않은 관여의 보도를 그 근거로 삼지 않는다 (ADR-0041 덧붙임 4 · 5)"@ko,
        "판단이 서지 않는다는 이유로 occurred 로 몰지 않는다."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf ostat: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ18;CQ20" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook occurrence_v1; frozen before coding on 2026-10-15" .

