prole:government a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "government"@en ;
    dcterms:source "registry/codebook_v1.0.csv (player_role, observed_n=255, status=in_use)"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/nuproc/codebook>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/core> ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0005>,
        <https://w3id.org/nuproc/adr/ADR-0006> ;
    skos:definition "The case in which the export-side actor is a government body or an intergovernmental organization."@en,
        "수출측 행위자가 정부 기관 또는 정부 간 기구인 경우."@ko ;
    skos:example "Government bodies of the exporting country and intergovernmental organizations. The source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) lists IAEA, IEA, ADB, EU, USTDA, US EXIM, DFC, KOICA, DOE and ÚOHS as entities to be treated as the government type; that list is not limited to the export side — bodies of the host country (e.g. ÚOHS) are on the counterparty side. This reading of the list is not yet confirmed."@en,
        "수출국 정부기관 및 정부간 기구. 매뉴얼 `entity_overrides.government` 목록은 IAEA, IEA, ADB, EU, USTDA, US EXIM, DFC, KOICA, DOE, ÚOHS 이나, 이는 '정부 유형으로 취급할 개체' 목록이며 수출측 전용이 아니다 — 도입국 기관(예: ÚOHS)은 counterparty 측이다. 연구자 확인 필요."@ko ;
    skos:inScheme prole: ;
    skos:notation "government" ;
    skos:prefLabel "government"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Definition carried over from codebook v1.0 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@en,
        "If a state-owned vendor acts as a commercial entity, soe_vendor."@en,
        "When the acting party is of a type that the source dataset's coding manual (not distributed) treats as government (ministries, export credit agencies, international organizations, etc.)."@en,
        "manual `entity_overrides.government` 에 열거된 유형 (부처, 수출신용기관, 국제기구 등)이 행위 주체일 때."@ko,
        "국유 벤더가 상업적 주체로 행위하면 soe_vendor (manual `soe_rule.default_role: B`)."@ko,
        "정의문은 codebook v1.0 의 것을 그대로 옮겼다 (registry/codebook_v1.0.csv)."@ko ;
    skos:topConceptOf prole: ;
    nuproc:justifyingCompetencyQuestion "CQ02" ;
    nuproc:status "codebook v1.0 v1.0-draft; observed_n=255; status=in_use" .

